---
import GardenLayout from '../../layouts/GardenLayout.astro';
const modules=[['01','坐标与位姿变换','旋转、平移、固定轴与自身轴。','frames'],['02','改进 D-H 建模','四个参数，串起一条运动链。','dh'],['03','正逆运动学','自由添加 1～8 节连杆，探索末端运动。','arm'],['04','雅可比与奇异性','看见关节速度与末端速度的关系。','jacobian']];
---
<GardenLayout title="学习空间 · 煦意"><div id="top"></div><section class="page-heading"><div class="eyebrow">LEARNING, BY DOING</div><h1>学习空间</h1><p>先把原理弄明白，再亲手试一试。<br/>把课程知识、可交互的模型和练习，放在同一个地方。</p></section><div class="learning-intro"><span>01 门课程 · 持续生长中</span><span>讲解 → 实验 → 练习 → 自测</span></div><section class="course-spotlight"><div class="course-illustration"><svg viewBox="0 0 500 290" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M40 235H460M130 30V260M40 80H460M40 130H460M40 180H460M180 30V260M230 30V260M280 30V260M330 30V260M380 30V260" stroke="#49624d" stroke-width=".7"/><circle cx="130" cy="235" r="180" stroke="#6d855e" stroke-dasharray="3 6"/><path d="M130 235L250 155L350 80" stroke="#b7c59c" stroke-width="14" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M250 155L350 80" stroke="#ddc596" stroke-width="7"/><circle cx="130" cy="235" r="11" stroke="#d6e5ae" fill="#233e2e" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="250" cy="155" r="9" stroke="#d6e5ae" fill="#233e2e" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="350" cy="80" r="5" fill="#e0c896"/><text x="364" y="73" fill="#bacb9c" font-size="12" font-family="monospace">E (x, y)</text><text x="65" y="55" fill="#8da47d" font-size="10" font-family="monospace">p = f(q)</text></svg><span>ROBO LAB / ROBOTICS</span></div><div class="course-copy"><div class="course-badges"><span>机器人学</span><span>交互课程</span></div><h3>把公式，<br/>变成看得见的运动。</h3><p>从坐标系、D-H 建模到正逆运动学。<br/>完整讲解、交互实验和闭卷训练，一步步来。</p><div class="course-facts"><span>4 个实验</span><span>16 节讲解</span><span>53 道练习</span></div><div class="learning-tools"><a class="garden-button" href="/learn/robotics/">进入实验室 ↗</a><a class="quiet-link" href="/learn/robotics/#lessons">先看知识讲解 →</a></div></div></section><section class="course-detail"><h2>这门课，可以这样学。</h2><div class="learning-modules">{modules.map(([number,title,description,tab])=><a href={`/learn/robotics/#lab/${tab}`}><small>EXPERIMENT {number}</small><h3>{title} ↗</h3><p>{description}</p></a>)}</div></section><div class="learning-tools"><a class="garden-button secondary" href="/learn/robotics/#practice">配套练习与错题本 →</a><a class="garden-button secondary" href="/learn/robotics/#exam">闭卷模拟 →</a><a class="quiet-link" href="/learn/robotics/机器人学期末复习册.docx" download>下载 Word 复习册 ↗</a></div><p class="reading-hint">学习进度、错题和机械臂配置保存在当前浏览器。<br/>建议先学坐标变换，再做 D-H 与运动学实验，最后用练习检验理解。</p></GardenLayout>
